  "document": "Gyara Hazar Ladkian\nGyara Hazar Ladkian (Eleven Thousand Girls ) is a 1962 Hindi romantic social drama film directed by K. A. Abbas. The film was co-produced by the poet Ali Sardar Jafri, who also helped co-write the story with Abbas."
